<title>ITALY: Dutch FinMin Zalm arrives for talks with Ciampi.</title>
<headline>Dutch FinMin Zalm arrives for talks with Ciampi.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Finance Minister Gerrit Zalm arrived for talks with Italian Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi on Wednesday. He did not talk to reporters when he entered the Treasury.</p>
<p>A source at the Treasury said Ciampi and Zalm would release a joint statement at around 1430 GMT which was expected to reiterate both countries' committment to the present timetable for European economic and monetary union (EMU).</p>
<p>No news conference is scheduled. -- Rome newsroom +39 6 6782501</p>
</text>
